{"logId": "323122ee-4407-436b-a0a7-9abe24c7a985", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——健康", "block_bbox": [165, 141, 456, 172], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[165.0, 141.0], [456.0, 141.0], [456.0, 172.0], [165.0, 172.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "四级【3~4分】：感恩生命中的一切经历和发生，能够从风雨和苦难中品出美好和幸福。", "block_bbox": [165, 215, 880, 240], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[165.0, 215.0], [880.0, 215.0], [880.0, 240.0], [165.0, 240.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "- 本条释义：基于对生命的理解和人生经历的沉淀，有非常深刻的人生感悟和很高的思想境界。对人生的起伏和生死都有非常豁达、圆润的状态。更多把生命当成是一种体验和感受，痛苦与幸福都同样值得品味，感恩和享受生命中的一切发生。", "block_bbox": [165, 274, 1016, 360], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[165.0, 274.0], [1016.0, 274.0], [1016.0, 360.0], [165.0, 360.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "符合的行为：", "block_bbox": [166, 402, 284, 424], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[166.0, 402.0], [283.0, 402.0], [283.0, 423.0], [166.0, 423.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、体验和感受不同生命阶段的美好", "block_bbox": [183, 442, 469, 464], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[183.0, 442.0], [469.0, 442.0], [469.0, 464.0], [183.0, 464.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、感恩生命、赞美生命", "block_bbox": [183, 473, 380, 494], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[183.0, 473.0], [379.0, 473.0], [379.0, 493.0], [183.0, 493.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、能够经历风雨的考验，勇敢地承担", "block_bbox": [183, 503, 488, 526], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[183.0, 503.0], [488.0, 503.0], [488.0, 526.0], [183.0, 526.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4、不拒绝苦难，能够从苦难中品味出美好和幸福", "block_bbox": [183, 534, 576, 556], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[183.0, 534.0], [576.0, 534.0], [576.0, 556.0], [183.0, 556.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "5、能够坦然释怀地面对变故和生死", "block_bbox": [183, 565, 471, 587], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[183.0, 565.0], [471.0, 565.0], [471.0, 587.0], [183.0, 587.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "[102]", "block_bbox": [570, 717, 615, 738], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[570.0, 717.0], [614.0, 717.0], [614.0, 737.0], [570.0, 737.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——健康", "block_bbox": [201, 901, 492, 932], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[201.0, 901.0], [492.0, 901.0], [492.0, 932.0], [201.0, 932.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "五级【4~5分】：活出洒脱、轻松、阳光、自由的生命状态，并影响和带动他人健康的观念和习惯。", "block_bbox": [201, 975, 1009, 1000], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[201.0, 975.0], [1009.0, 975.0], [1009.0, 1000.0], [201.0, 1000.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "- 本条释义：能够突破束缚和传统，培养健全的人格，活出洒脱、轻松、阳光、个性、自由的生命状态，并能够影响和带动更多人的思想观念和生命状态。", "block_bbox": [201, 1035, 1049, 1089], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 13, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[201.0, 1035.0], [1049.0, 1035.0], [1049.0, 1089.0], [201.0, 1089.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "符合的行为：", "block_bbox": [202, 1132, 319, 1154], "block_id": 13, "block_order": 14, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[202.0, 1132.0], [318.0, 1132.0], [318.0, 1153.0], [202.0, 1153.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、不违背自由，尊重自由、坚信自由、保持轻松的精神面貌", "block_bbox": [218, 1171, 703, 1194], "block_id": 14, "block_order": 15, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[218.0, 1171.0], [703.0, 1171.0], [703.0, 1194.0], [218.0, 1194.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、能够突破传统文化和社会主流文化的束缚和枷锁，自由自在地活出真实的自己", "block_bbox": [218, 1201, 862, 1224], "block_id": 15, "block_order": 16, "group_id": 15, "block_polygon_points": [[218.0, 1201.0], [862.0, 1201.0], [862.0, 1224.0], [218.0, 1224.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、拥有健全人格，洒脱、轻松、阳光、个性的生命状态", "block_bbox": [219, 1230, 666, 1252], "block_id": 16, "block_order": 17, "group_id": 16, "block_polygon_points": [[219.0, 1230.0], [666.0, 1230.0], [666.0, 1252.0], [219.0, 1252.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4、随心而行，遵从自我内心", "block_bbox": [219, 1260, 451, 1281], "block_id": 17, "block_order": 18, "group_id": 17, "block_polygon_points": [[219.0, 1260.0], [450.0, 1260.0], [450.0, 1280.0], [219.0, 1280.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "5、基于真正的自信和自爱，觉得自己是世界上最美的人", "block_bbox": [219, 1289, 666, 1311], "block_id": 18, "block_order": 19, "group_id": 18, "block_polygon_points": [[219.0, 1289.0], [666.0, 1289.0], [666.0, 1311.0], [219.0, 1311.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "6、七八十分是最好的状态，不苛求完美，轻松幸福最重要", "block_bbox": [219, 1318, 684, 1340], "block_id": 19, "block_order": 20, "group_id": 19, "block_polygon_points": [[219.0, 1318.0], [684.0, 1318.0], [684.0, 1340.0], [219.0, 1340.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "7、远离让自己不开心的人和事，能够爱有情之人、放无心之手", "block_bbox": [219, 1347, 719, 1369], "block_id": 20, "block_order": 21, "group_id": 20, "block_polygon_points": [[219.0, 1347.0], [719.0, 1347.0], [719.0, 1369.0], [219.0, 1369.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "8、能够影响和带动身边人以及更多人健康的思想观念和生活习惯", "block_bbox": [220, 1377, 738, 1400], "block_id": 21, "block_order": 22, "group_id": 21, "block_polygon_points": [[220.0, 1377.0], [738.0, 1377.0], [738.0, 1400.0], [220.0, 1400.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "[103]", "block_bbox": [608, 1478, 653, 1497], "block_id": 22, "block_order": null, "group_id": 22, "block_polygon_points": [[608.0, 1478.0], [652.0, 1478.0], [652.0, 1496.0], [608.0, 1496.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8329131603240967, "coordinate": [165, 141, 456, 172], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[165.0, 141.0], [456.0, 141.0], [456.0, 172.0], [165.0, 172.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8016432523727417, "coordinate": [165, 215, 880, 240], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[165.0, 215.0], [880.0, 215.0], [880.0, 240.0], [165.0, 240.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.920569121837616, "coordinate": [165, 274, 1016, 360], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[165.0, 274.0], [1016.0, 274.0], [1016.0, 360.0], [165.0, 360.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.6997593641281128, "coordinate": [166, 402, 284, 424], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[166.0, 402.0], [283.0, 402.0], [283.0, 423.0], [166.0, 423.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7792383432388306, "coordinate": [183, 442, 469, 464], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[183.0, 442.0], [469.0, 442.0], [469.0, 464.0], [183.0, 464.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7740792632102966, "coordinate": [183, 473, 380, 494], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[183.0, 473.0], [379.0, 473.0], [379.0, 493.0], [183.0, 493.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.806633472442627, "coordinate": [183, 503, 488, 526], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[183.0, 503.0], [488.0, 503.0], [488.0, 526.0], [183.0, 526.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7929587364196777, "coordinate": [183, 534, 576, 556], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[183.0, 534.0], [576.0, 534.0], [576.0, 556.0], [183.0, 556.0]]}, {"cls_